- `.claude/skills/frontend-async-best-practices/rules/parallel.md`: When async operations have no interdependencies, execute them concurrently using `Promise.all()`.
- `.claude/skills/frontend-async-best-practices/rules/suspense-boundaries.md`: Instead of awaiting data in async components before returning JSX, use Suspense boundaries to show the wrapper UI faster while data loads.

