- `.claude/skills/graph-schema/references/scale-supernode-mitigation.md`: A supernode is a node with thousands to millions of relationships — a popular celebrity's followers, a global `:Country` node connected to every citizen, a `:Tag` like "javascript" linked to millions of articles. Traversing all relationships of a supernode is slow and memory-intensive, and it blo...
