- `.claude/skills/pocketbase-best-practices/rules/ext-js-migrations.md`: JSVM migrations live in `pb_migrations/` next to the executable. Unlike Go migrations (which use `init()` + `m.Register(...)` inside a package imported from `main.go`), JSVM migrations are **auto-discovered by filename** and call the global `migrate()` function with an `up` callback and an option...
