- `.claude/skills/react-best-practices/upstream/rules/rendering-hydration-suppress-warning.md`: In SSR frameworks (e.g., Next.js), some values are intentionally different on server vs client (random IDs, dates, locale/timezone formatting). For these *expected* mismatches, wrap the dynamic text in an element with `suppressHydrationWarning` to prevent noisy warnings. Do not use this to hide r...
