- `.claude/skills/react-best-practices/upstream/rules/rerender-memo-with-default-value.md`: When memoized component has a default value for some non-primitive optional parameter, such as an array, function, or object, calling the component without that parameter results in broken memoization. This is because new value instances are created on every rerender, and they do not pass strict...
