- `.claude/skills/storefront-best-practices/reference/components/product-slider.md`: Product slider (carousel) displays multiple products horizontally with navigation to scroll through them. Used for related products, recently viewed, bestsellers, and featured products.
- `.claude/skills/storefront-best-practices/reference/components/search.md`: Search is critical for ecommerce - users with search intent convert at higher rates. Provide fast, relevant product discovery with autocomplete.
- `.claude/skills/storefront-best-practices/reference/connecting-to-backend.md`: Best practices for connecting storefront to ecommerce backend APIs. Framework-agnostic patterns for authentication, cart state management, error handling, and performance optimization.
