- `.claude/skills/vue-best-practices/reference/ts-provide-inject-injection-key.md`: **Impact: MEDIUM** - When using `provide/inject` with TypeScript, use `InjectionKey<T>` with Symbol to achieve type-safe dependency injection. Without it, injected values have `unknown` type or require manual type assertions.
