- `.claude/skills/vue-debug-guides/reference/slot-render-scope-parent-only.md`: **Impact: HIGH** - Slot content is compiled in the parent component's scope and cannot access data defined in the child component. This follows JavaScript's lexical scoping rules and is a common source of confusion.
