- `.claude/skills/vue-debug-guides/reference/suspense-ssr-hydration-issues.md`: In SSR applications, hydration mismatches cause: - Visual flickering as the client re-renders - Loss of state in affected components - Console warnings in development (silent failures in production) - Potential runtime crashes in edge cases - Poor user experience, especially on slower networks
